@startuml causal_journal
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/main/proveo.puml
title New flat causal journal - actual mutation integration
start
:Bind actual native operands to stable private engine IDs;
:Capture logical group's live causal recipient geometry;
:Emit typed effects at native mutation sites;
:Record only actual successful target consumption;
:Attach target-only observation before casualty clearing;
:Emit changed recipient cells after the group;
:Validate final entities, modes, mines and lives against kernel;
:Validate bounded standard JSON / Zod journal;
:Stage both recipient successors before commit;
note right
  No old companion/frame-key/authority wire.
  Speculative prefix visibility stays private.
  IDs and parse success grant no runtime permission.
  No F9 or training-readiness claim.
end note
stop
@enduml
